# Tab-separated measurement data is parsed by column, not by line ending, and is
# read back on Linux runners as well as here. Pin it to LF so a checkout on a
# machine with core.autocrlf=true cannot put a stray CR in the last column.
#
# DELIBERATELY SCOPED TO *.tsv. A repository-wide `* text=auto eol=lf` would be
# the more complete answer, but it renormalises every tracked text file on the
# next commit -- a diff touching the whole repository, which is not a thing to
# hide inside a licensing fix. That stays a separate decision.
*.tsv text eol=lf
